              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri Israeli aka Waaqi irree guddooni worra Misiri dabsate arginaani AABBO Waaqafi Musa hojattu isaale d'ugeefate.",
          "type": "text",
